WEBVTT

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.660
Now I'll announce the results of the class vote.

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:09.300
We of Class 2-2 shall be putting on a fashion show for this year's culture festival.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.470
Ooh, a fashion show! Sounds like fun!

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:21.010
Well, sure should be! Our own Paris Fashion Week!

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.880
Sounds dull. I'm leaving.

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.350
A fashion show would just be fun for the girls.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:35.760
I'm not doing it.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:47.040
<i>What about our class show? What's going to happen to </i>that?<i></i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:51.500
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.370
Smile Precure!

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:54.230
Let's go!

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:55.770
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:56.900
All together!

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.500
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.710
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:03.380
Smile Precure!

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:08.210
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:13.650
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:18.860
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:24.800
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:29.730
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:29.700
So bright!

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:34.910
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:41.350
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:41.850
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:43.010
Let's go!

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:45.720
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:48.650
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:53.460
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:54.030
Girls! Let's go!

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.690
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:56.830
Everybody!

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:58.500
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.030
Fly to the future!

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:04.540
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:06.710
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:09.010
Smile Precure!

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:18.360
Black noses...

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:22.030
You can never be too wary of Joker's little presents-da wasa.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:26.640
I'm going to need a plan-da wasa...

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:32.640
Ah, I know-da wasa... I've got just the thing to pin all five of those brats down at once-da wasa!

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:50.960
I wonder if we can get Toyoshima-kun to help us with the festival...

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:54.560
Perhaps a majority vote was not the best way to handle the matter.

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:56.900
I don't think that's the problem here.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.570
Gotta wonder why he's makin' such a big deal of it...

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:06.910
Still, the culture festival only comes round once a year...

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.110
It'd be nice if we could get everyone on board!

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:14.020
Yeah-kuru! Things are more fun when you do them together-kuru!

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:16.790
Yup! And we ain't gonna get anywhere by mopin'!

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:20.620
Perhaps we should ask him what his objection to the show is.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:25.700
Sounds like a plan! When we know that, we can figure out how to make this festival happen!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.400
I'll ask my mom and get some fabric and stuff for the fashion show!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.970
Oh, nice one!

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:31.830
Awesome!

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:32.670
We're countin' on ya!

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:42.150
See, with real fashion shows, it's not just all about the models.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:45.750
There's a whole staff of people making sure everything's just right.

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:50.790
People to make the clothes, to operate the lighting, or design the stage itself.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.890
There's plenty for everyone to do!

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:56.230
Your mom works in the fashion business, doesn't she, Yayoi-chan?

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:57.190
That's so cool!

00:03:57.730 --> 00:04:01.660
Something else she told me was that it's important to have a theme.

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:02.570
A theme?

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:05.030
A common theme for all the costumes, you know!

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:08.810
I know! Why don't we go with fairytales?

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:09.770
Fairytales?

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:13.740
Yeah! We could all dress up as our favorite fairytale characters!

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:18.720
We could be people we normally don't get to be! I think it'd be a lot of fun!

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:20.620
A fairytale theme, huh...

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:21.780
Yeah, that might be fun!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:24.890
I'd love to dress up like a princess!

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:27.420
And there's lots of cute animals and fairies too!

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:29.860
Well, why don't we split up into teams, then?

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:33.060
Like a Snow White team, and a Momotarou team!

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:35.500
That way everyone can go up on stage!

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:39.370
We could have the announcers and designers in costumes too!

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:40.470
I like it!

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:41.670
That could be a lot of fun!

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:44.010
Then we'll be the Crab and the Monkey team!

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.110
I'll be the monkey!

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.480
Then I'll be the chestnut!

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:47.810
You'd be better off as the barrel!

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:49.950
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:56.150
Hey, good morning, Toyoshima-kun!

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:01.520
Say, what do you wanna be, Toyoshima-kun?

00:05:01.890 --> 00:05:06.730
We've all just been talking about what outfits would be fun to wear!

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:08.100
Who cares?

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:10.330
I'm not doing it, alright?!

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.810
Seriously, what's up with him?

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:21.710
Miyuki?!

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.920
Wait, Toyoshima-kun!

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:27.750
What?

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:31.390
Come on, Toyoshima-kun! You've gotta help us with the fashion show!

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:34.920
I'm sure it'll be a lot of fun if we all work together!

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:37.360
I don't wanna.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:40.060
Toyoshima!

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:44.030
You guys?

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:45.700
Just what were you up to?

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:48.910
Making a band for the festival was <i>your</i> idea, wasn't it?

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:50.870
Guess that was all talk, huh?!

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:55.350
W-Well, I did want to, but...

00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:59.220
We can't force the class to do what we want...

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:01.950
Suit yourself!

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:04.650
But unless there's a band involved, don't try and force me!

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:09.260
Has Toyoshima-kun played in a band before?

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.090
Yeah.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:13.000
He's seriously good at the guitar.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:17.170
He was really pumped up about wanting to perform at the festival...

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:18.740
Oh...

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:20.500
I guess that explains it.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.710
Yeah, okay, but he ain't got the right to throw his weight around like that.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:30.180
I'm sure he was really pumped about the band, but this is a <i>class</i> event.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:34.280
Perhaps we should have collated more viewpoints before we made a decision...

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:37.620
But it's not like a band is something everyone can take part in.

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:41.760
It's not exactly easy finding an idea everyone can help with...

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:46.560
Aren't fashion shows meant to be fun-kuru?

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:50.430
Yeah, I reckon they are, but...

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.500
Hey, that's what we should do!

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:57.970
We'll just have to show Toyoshima-kun how much fun working on the fashion show would be!

00:06:58.740 --> 00:06:59.910
Sounds good!

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:02.310
Let's invite him to join us during the preparations.

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:05.320
Hopefully he'll want to work on it with us eventually!

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:08.080
Alright then, let's give that a shot!

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:22.970
Toyoshima-kun!

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:24.900
Look at this!

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:28.500
We're gonna use fairytales as the theme for our fashion show!

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:32.780
I bet we could come up with an outfit that suits you, so please come help us!

00:07:34.940 --> 00:07:36.410
I don't wanna do it!

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.980
Ah man...

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:43.950
The sleeve measurement is... 45cm.

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:46.920
Give it an extra 0.8cm for sewing!

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:48.690
I've got us some cloth!

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:50.230
Nice one!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.960
Wow, you're good at that, Midorikawa!

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:54.560
You wanna go?

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:56.770
Right hand on the button here...

00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:58.170
...and then just press down with your foot...

00:07:58.170 --> 00:07:58.940
Whoa!

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:07.340
Hey, look, Toyoshima!

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:10.550
Tada! We're the three little pigs!

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:14.420
Huh, well, doesn't that just suit you perfectly?!

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:16.290
Haha, thanks for the compliment!

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:19.590
Are you saying we look like pigs now, huh?!

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:24.030
Do you have any suggestions for background music for the show?

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:25.630
Nope.

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.630
What color lighting do you think we should have on this scene?

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:30.900
I don't care!

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:32.840
You think this works for a finishing pose?

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:34.070
Or this, maybe?!

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:35.240
Will you quit it already?!

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:38.980
Toyoshima's a tough nut to crack...

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:41.140
He won't even give us the time of day...

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:45.010
Still, at least our preparations are coming along smoothly.

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:49.750
Yeah. But he'd better hurry up, or we won't have time to make him a costume...

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:55.020
We should sort out our hairstyles, too!

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.460
Toyoshima-kun!

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:58.860
Take a look at this!

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:00.700
What is it?

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:02.970
It's part of a costume I made yesterday!

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:07.340
I think you'd look really fetching in this feathered hat, Toyoshima-kun!

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:10.870
How many times I gotta tell you? I ain't doing it!

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:14.680
Will you grow up already, Toyoshima?!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:17.250
This was a class decision!

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:20.050
Your whining is just plain unreasonable!

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:21.990
So what?

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.020
It's none of your business.

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:25.490
Business?

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:26.990
<i>It's totally our business!</i>

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:29.430
Whoa! Stop it, Nao-chan!

00:09:28.490 --> 00:09:29.430
Calm it!

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:31.290
Nao-chan!

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:33.230
Nao-chan...

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:34.760
I just...

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:44.810
It's done!

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:46.840
It looks really cute!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:51.880
Everyone looks quite wonderful!

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:53.950
This is kinda embarrassing...

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:56.990
I never dreamed I'd ever get to model like this!

00:09:57.290 --> 00:10:02.330
It was a brilliant idea of yours to give everyone a chance to model, Miyuki-chan!

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:06.300
I just thought it'd be nice if everyone got some limelight, you know?

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:09.200
Everyone's looking fantastic!

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:14.970
Oh, hey, Toyoshima-kun!

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:17.670
Look!  Doesn't everyone look great?

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:20.010
You should come join us too!

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:23.450
We're nearly ready to pack up, but I'm sure we could make you—

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:25.220
I don't want anything to do with it!

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:32.160
Would you quit bein' such a hardass and just join in?!

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:37.030
Wa—

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.530
Toyoshima!

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:44.870
Is he <i>that</i> serious about not doing it?

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:47.970
At first I wanted us to do a dance,

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:51.340
but now I'm really excited about putting on this fashion show!

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:53.580
Yeah, it's a shame he won't help...

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:54.680
What can we do?

00:10:55.010 --> 00:11:00.280
He's told us himself how he feels, so give it up, Hoshizora.

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:15.600
I... I think if we're going to do this, we have to do it right.

00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:25.340
Yeah... can't say I'm too happy about leavin' him the odd man out.

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:29.380
We've gotta do what it takes to include everyone!

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:35.820
I wonder if we can't find a way of ensuring nobody is excluded from this festival...

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:42.960
I'm gonna go try and talk to Toyoshima-kun again!

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:48.700
Sunny!

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:55.580
March!

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:03.020
Where'd Toyoshima get off to?

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.740
Why'd everything have to turn out like this?

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:28.470
I just want to have fun like everyone else is...

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:33.680
Oh, you'll do nicely-da wasa!

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:37.520
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.390
...a Bad End-da wasa!

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:44.590
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness-da wasa!

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:48.560
Toyoshima-kun!

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:59.140
The Bad Energy we gather from these humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, Pierrot-sama, da wasa!

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:04.210
Miyuki!

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:08.380
And I know just what to make my new Akanbe from-da wasa!

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:11.680
Come forth, Hyper Akanbe!

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:23.330
<i>This is unbelievable-da wasa...!</i>

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:25.630
Hyper Akanbe!

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.570
She transformed Toyoshima-kun's guitar!

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.540
Hurry up and transform too-kuru!

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:30.440
Right!

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:35.410
Ready?

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:38.650
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:39.710
Go!

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:42.550
Go, go!

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.020
Let's go!

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:15.180
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:18.250
Cure Happy!

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.160
Dazzling sun!

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:25.090
Hot-blooded power!

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.560
Cure Sunny!

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:33.230
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:36.300
Cure Peace!

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:42.040
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:45.080
Cure March!

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:51.080
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:53.920
Cure Beauty!

00:14:56.090 --> 00:14:58.790
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:09.000
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:14.510
I'm going to beat you Precure down once and for all-da wasa!

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:18.210
Akanbe!

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:21.150
What is that noise?!

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:23.350
It's drivin' me crazy!

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:28.020
Good luck dodging an audial attack, brats-da wasa!

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:29.990
I cannot abide this dissonance!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.590
My head's gonna explode!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.890
Make it stop-kuru!

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:36.500
Hey, that's better-kuru...

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:38.400
There's no stopping me today-da wasa!

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:42.440
Girls!

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:49.640
Hyper!

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:54.410
Take that!

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:00.290
Oh no-kuru! The Precure are in trouble-kuru!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:03.360
Aka, aka, akan, akanbe!

00:16:03.990 --> 00:16:05.560
What should I do-kuru?!

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:09.260
Hyper Akanbe!

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:11.030
That's it-kuru!

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:14.570
Let's Go: Banana!

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:20.070
Be, be, be, Akanbe!

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:22.940
Say your prayers, Precure-da wasa!

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:27.610
Hy-hyper!

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:32.990
Akanbe?!

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:35.090
This is bananas!

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:38.320
That killed her music!

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:39.230
Alright!

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:40.660
Nice one, Candy!

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:42.560
Now's your chance, everyone-kuru!

00:16:45.970 --> 00:16:49.500
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.290
Princess Happy!

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:08.490
Princess Sunny!

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:10.690
Princess Peace!

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:12.890
Princess March!

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:15.090
Princess Beauty!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:23.070
Precure: Princess Form!

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:31.010
Reveal your secrets, Royal Clock!

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:34.880
Combine our powers together-kuru!

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:50.330
May the light of hope shine!

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:54.530
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.470
Precure...

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:05.040
Royal Rainbow...

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:07.880
Burst!

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:15.820
Akanbe...!

00:18:21.090 --> 00:18:24.560
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:18:34.370 --> 00:18:37.710
We got another new Décor-kuru!

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:41.920
That really took the wind out of me-da wasa...

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:45.220
I'll get you runts for that-da wasa!

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:50.690
You did great back there, Candy!

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:55.730
Well, I'm part of the team-kuru! I'm always here to help-kuru!

00:18:55.730 --> 00:19:00.930
Yup! We've all gotta do what we can to help out!

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:04.170
Hey, that's it!

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:05.170
Huh...?

00:19:08.510 --> 00:19:09.480
My...

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:11.980
My guitar!

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:23.320
You really love your guitar, don't you, Toyoshima-kun?

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:25.890
Hoshizora...

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:30.000
Yeah... I do...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:33.500
My guitar's about the only thing I'm good at...

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:35.770
Sorry...

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:39.940
I knew us putting a band together was a pipe dream, but I still...

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:44.280
Hey, Toyoshima-kun...

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:47.810
There's a very important role we need you to fill for us!

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:50.780
Would you mind lending us a hand?

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:53.820
We've gotta make this the best festival ever!

00:19:57.490 --> 00:19:58.990
Welcome, everyone!

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:00.460
Please, come in!

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:01.590
Over here!

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:03.430
Come on in!

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:06.000
Sure, come right in!

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:09.840
Thank you for coming today.

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:13.540
We'd now like to present Class 2-2's Fairytale Kingdom Fashion Show!

00:20:14.070 --> 00:20:14.970
One, two...
